{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/productionhome2022-hash/mawda-platform/pulls/59","id":5409900754,"node_id":"PR_kwDOVjVyDc8AAAABQnSI0g","html_url":"https://github.com/productionhome2022-hash/mawda-platform/pull/59","diff_url":"https://github.com/productionhome2022-hash/mawda-platform/pull/59.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/productionhome2022-hash/mawda-platform/pull/59.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/productionhome2022-hash/mawda-platform/issues/59","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/productionhome2022-hash/mawda-platform/pulls/59/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/productionhome2022-hash/mawda-platform/pulls/59/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/productionhome2022-hash/mawda-platform/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/productionhome2022-hash/mawda-platform/issues/59/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/productionhome2022-hash/mawda-platform/statuses/b78817d0e6d7a73398fcce1d54c7df4f6707d045","number":59,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix(calls): revalidate direct-call participants in transaction","user":{"login":"productionhome2022-hash","id":348720557,"node_id":"U_kgDOFMkNrQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/348720557?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash","html_url":"https://github.com/productionhome2022-hash","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n- Re-reads the direct chat and peer member inside the `startCall` Firestore transaction, in addition to the caller record already read there.\n- Revalidates the exact two-member chat participant set, both members' active/complete account state, age-class compatibility and mutual block relationship before creating the call.\n- Adds a focused pure policy helper and tests for changed chat membership, invalid participant sets, cross-age-class calls and blocks.\n\n## Root cause addressed\nThe direct-call preflight read the peer profile, age class, block lists and chat membership before entering the transaction, but the transaction re-read only the caller. A peer could be suspended, blocked, change age eligibility, or leave/change the direct chat between preflight and call creation. This PR closes that time-of-check/time-of-use gap for direct-call creation.\n\n## Scope and safety\n- Does not change call duration, quotas, pricing, billing, room-call behavior or signaling protocol.\n- Uses server-owned Firestore documents; no client-supplied membership or block state is trusted.\n- No production Firebase changes, main merge or deployment.\n\n## Validation\n- Exact-head Validate Mawda and Emulator results are recorded below.\n- Includes unit tests for the direct-call eligibility policy and the existing direct/room call-signaling Emulator lifecycle.\n\n## Exact-head validation — 2026-11-20\n- Head SHA: `f6cdf552494e222c2cefd3a4d27ca36515fd93cf`.\n- Validate Mawda run [44699159743](https://github.com/productionhome2022-hash/mawda-platform/actions/runs/44699159743): **success**.\n- Cloud Functions compile/unit + emulator job: 39/39 steps succeeded, including the call-signaling Firestore Emulator integration suite, wallet/store concurrency, role capacity, media authorization/legal hold, retention, privacy, Firestore/Storage rules.\n- Flutter analysis/tests/web release and production-configured web candidate build: 16/16 steps succeeded.\n- Isolated ClamAV scanner source/security, image build, sanitization and EICAR detection: 11/11 steps succeeded.\n- This is exact-head CI/Emulator evidence only; it is not device acceptance, signed mobile release, production deployment or 5,000-persona acceptance.\n- PR remains Draft/open/unmerged pending review and integration decision.\n\n\n## Follow-up edge-case coverage — 2026-11-20\n- Latest head SHA: `b78817d0e6d7a73398fcce1d54c7df4f6707d045`; added fail-closed tests for missing caller/peer snapshots, malformed participant arrays and invalid identity.\n- Exact-head Domain Regression run [44699960808](https://github.com/productionhome2022-hash/mawda-platform/actions/runs/44699960808): **success** (Flutter 9/9, retention/room emulator regression 17/17).\n- Exact-head Validate Mawda run [44699960699](https://github.com/productionhome2022-hash/mawda-platform/actions/runs/44699960699): still in progress at this update; ClamAV 11/11 success, Flutter and Cloud Functions jobs continuing. Do not treat latest head as fully validated until it completes.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-20T08:00:34Z","updated_at":"2026-11-26T16:53:55Z","closed_at":"2026-11-20T08:16:31Z","merged_at":"2026-11-20T08:16:31Z","merge_commit_sha":"39b65215584ccb8b70cf3d22fc3f2a18fcf5714a","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"productionhome2022-hash:codex/phase1-direct-call-transaction-revalidation-2026-11-20","ref":"codex/phase1-direct-call-transaction-revalidation-2026-11-20","repo":{"id":1446343181,"node_id":"R_kgDOVjVyDQ","name":"mawda-platform","full_name":"productionhome2022-hash/mawda-platform","owner":{"login":"productionhome2022-hash